    "id": 5436,
    "slug": "property-management",
    "title": "Property Management",
    "description": "Comprehensive property management for luxury real estate in Dubai: Why choose Cordova? Expertise and Experience: We understand the intricacies of the Dubai real estate market and we leverage this expertise to maximise your property’s potential. wich is why we ",
    "excerpt": "Comprehensive property management for luxury real estate in Dubai: Why choose Cordova? Expertise and Experience: We understand the intricacies of the Dubai real estate market and we leverage this expertise to maximise your property’s potential. wich is why we ",
    "content": "Comprehensive property management for luxury real estate in Dubai: Why choose Cordova?\n\n CHECKOUT OUR PROPERTY MANAGEMENT PACKAGES\n\n GET OUR GUIDE FOR DUABAI LANDLORDS\n\n GET OUR CHECKLIST FOR DUBAI TENANTS\n\n Expertise and Experience:\n\n We understand the intricacies of the Dubai real estate market and we leverage this expertise to maximise your property’s potential. wich is why we are one of the stand-out property management companies in Dubai.\n\n Time-Saving:\n\n Managing a property requires significant time and effort. From handling tenant queries to overseeing maintenance, the demands on landlords can be overwhelming. Our Property Managers free up your time, allowing you to focus on other important aspects of your life or business.\n\n Tenant Management:\n\n We ensure that your property attracts and retains quality tenants. Our thorough tenant screening process helps minimise risks, and our responsive tenant support systems ensure high satisfaction and long-term occupancy.\n\n Financial Management:\n\n From rent collection to maintenance and expenses, we provide detailed financial reporting to keep you informed on your property's performance. Our efficient financial management service helps you maximise returns and minimise costs.\n\n Maintenance and Repairs:\n\n Keeping your property in pristine condition is crucial for maintaining its value. We organise regular maintenance and handle repairs promptly, ensuring your investment retains an air of luxury for your tenants.\n\n Legal Compliance:\n\n Regulations are constantly evolving. Navigating the legal requirements associated with property management can be complex. Our team stay up-to-date with the latest regulations to check that your property complies with all local laws, protecting you from potential legal issues.\n\n Market Insights:\n\n Our deep understanding of the Dubai real estate market allows us to provide strategic advice on rental pricing, market trends, and investment opportunities. We help you make informed decisions to enhance your property's profitability.\n\n Why You Need Property Management\n\n Have a look at our informative property management video which details the main services our dedicated team will provide\n\n Expert Property Management Dubai | Cordova PM\n\nWatch this video on YouTube\n\n Our Property Management Services\n\n Basic Package\n\n 5% of Annual Rent\n\n Minimum Fee AED 5,000 +5% VAT\n\n Personal Property Manager\n\n Marketing of Property\n\n Finding Tenant\n\n Deposit hold and release upon approval\n\n Key handover and tenant move-in\n\n Banking rent cheques into the owner’s account\n\n Renewal of Tenancy Contract\n\n Checking RERA calculator for rent increase\n\n Re-market when the property becomes vacant\n\n Premium Package\n\n 7% of Annual Rent\n\n Minimum Fee AED 7,000 AED +5% VAT\n\n Personal Property Manager\n\n Marketing of Property\n\n Finding Tenant\n\n Key Holding\n\n Deposit hold and release upon approval\n\n DEWA Connection Assistance\n\n Ejari Registration Assistance\n\n Key handover to tenant\n\n Banking rent cheques into the owner’s account\n\n Onboarding Inspection, Move-In Inspection, Bi-Annual Inspection & Moved-Out Inspection\n\n Renewal of Tenancy Contract\n\n Checking RERA calculator for rent increase\n\n Re-market when the property becomes vacant\n\n Snag reporting for off-plan properties directly with the developer.\n\n Payments to third-party vendors (Mollak-service charges etc.)\n\n Coordinating with the facility management teams in buildings/community.\n\n Detailed property inspections with photographs\n\n Pre-inspection, move-in. move-out and mid tenancy.\n\n Manage security deposit reimbursement\n\n Tenant Management",
    "image": "https://property.breakout-website.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Dubai-Property1.jpg",
    "sourceUrl": "https://cordovaproperty.com/property-management/",
    "type": "page",
